window.products.push({"id":702013,"name":"Hunter HP800 Multi-Room Whole Home Console Air Purifier Features Energy Star Certification True HEPA Filter, Multiple Fan Speeds, Soft Touch Digital C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i7Cni5KNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style meets performance with the Hunter HP800 Large Console Air Purifier. At the top of its class, this air purifier can clean the air in multiple rooms or a whole home over 31 times each day for allergy and asthma relief. After the air enters the air purifier, it passes through a coconut carbon pre-filter which neutralizes harmful VOCs (volatile organic compounds) and household odors from cooking, cleaning, smoking and pets. The air then passes through a True HEPA filter which removes up to 99. 97 percent of airborne particles as small as 0. 3 microns including smoke, dust, pollen, pet hair and dander, mold spores and dust mite debris. It’s recommended to change the HEPA filter every 6-12 months and pre-filter every 3 months, or more often depending on air quality and environmental factors. While it may be compact, its power makes this air purifier ideal for a large bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, living room or other large space in your home. The soft touch digital control panel makes it easy to control settings. Features 4 fan speeds so you get the cleaning power you want, when you want it. Also features sleep mode with whisper quiet operation for uninterrupted sleep, timer, filter replacement indicator to remind you when it’s time to change the filters, and optional LED accent light for ambiance or nightlight. Energy Star Certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i7Cni5KNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hunter Fan Company","source_asin":"B0BWS54QSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWS54QSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWS54QSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
