window.products.push({"id":702041,"name":"2 Pack Silicone Steam Release Diverter Compatible with Instant Pot Accessories 3/5/6/8 Quart -For Insta Pot Pressure Cooker Duo/Duo Plus/Smart/Ultra M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CwZwbRhoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【COMPATIBLE WITH INSTANT POT MODELS】- For Mini 3qt, 5qt ,6qt, 8qt, all IP DUO, Ultra and Smart Models. But not fit for LUX MODEL!!! ❤【FOOD GRADE SILICONE】- Our two pack steam release diverters(grey & red) are made from highest food grade silicon which is heat-resistant. Choose the safe and healthy silicone steam release accessories. ❤【UPGRADE VERSION DESIGN】- Our upgraded steam diverter won’t press the valve and can make it work normally. The one vent on each side design keep the steam go fast and better to release steam than other items having only one vent on the market. The symmetrical 2 vents design make it easy to keep balance and seal, so it can stand up straight and doesn't lean. Each IP should have one. ❤【CABINET PROTECTOR】- The steam release insta pot accessory is a brilliant solution for protecting your cabinet. Depending on the 2 vents design, it releases steam from both side and greatly REDUCES the steaming air flow to the cabinet. It’s amazing at redirecting hot steam to other direction than getting to cabinet directly and protects it away from moisture and warping. No need to move the insta pot away from cabinet again when you release the pressure. ❤【EASY TO USE & CLEAN】- Before cooking, simply put the steam diverter on the valve, after cooking, rotate the accessory to release steam and then it can divert hot steam to other direction instead of the cupboard. And It's super easy to clean under soapy water. Dishwasher safe too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CwZwbRhoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vnray","source_asin":"B07HK2BP9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HK2BP9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HK2BP9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
