window.products.push({"id":702127,"name":"Summer Sale! Lemon Zester-Cheese Grater+Vegetable Swivel Peeler+Safety Cover+Cooking EBook, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pJvA1MJrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready to become an artist in your kitchen and bar! The Avanchy pro zester delivers quality and convenience so that you can explore flavor and infuse your dishes with the freshest, most flavorful ingredients. The pro zester grater is made from rustproof, durable stainless steel that comes ready to use and will hold up for years to come. The avanchy pro zester is razor sharp and designed to achieve the finest zest. Plus, Avanchy products are designed for everyday use as an integral part of your culinary experience and the pro zester is guaranteed to stay sharp longer than the competition. Grab onto the bpa-free silicone handle and rest the grater feet on the built-in, non-slip blade tips to ensure a secure hold from both ends. Keep your hands free of the sharp surface to avoid injury and zest in a fraction of the time. The snap-on protective cover also adds to your safety and comfort. Use this versatile kitchen tool as a standard lemon zester, innovative vegetable grater or durable cheese grater for the hardest, most flavorful cheeses! Rediscover power and passion in your kitchen with high quality, beautiful dishes that are presented with appealing designs and filled with flavor. With the pro zester and avanchy peeler bonus product in hand, every recipe is within reach. Create delicate tapas plates with smooth layers of razor thin, fresh vegetables and zest a light dusting of cheese to finish off every meal. Cool off in the summer with fancy cocktails that impress your guests and win the award for detail and flavor with a gentle grating of cool lime. As the snow falls, warm up with the comfort of fresh nutmeg, cinnamon and ginger zest, filling your home with authentic fragrance. Take your cuisine to the next level with flavorful, zesty detail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pJvA1MJrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avanchy","source_asin":"B0106NG6SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0106NG6SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0106NG6SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
