window.products.push({"id":702191,"name":"Ellis Curtain Regatta 68 by 72-Inch Tailored Panel Pair Curtains with Tiebacks, Sangria","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cIeLEZSbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ellis Curtain Regatta Small Textured Check Tailored Pair Of Drape Panels with Tiebacks Textures are a great way to add contrast to your home. The use of texture is one of the most important principles of good design, and the use of subtle textures is becoming more and more popular in the world of interior design. We’ve created the Regatta Curtain program with this in mind. The Regatta is a small textured check on colored ground that’s subtle and sensuous yet rich enough to create balance within your home décor. Made with 52-percent polyester/48-percent 5-ounce cotton duck fabric creates a smooth draping effect, soft texture and easy maintenance. Each curtain panel is constructed with a 1-1/2-inch rod pocket, 2-1/2-inch header, and 5-inch bottom hem. Sold in pairs (2 Panels) Width is measured overall 68-inch per pair of panels (both 34-inch panels together) Length is measured overall 72-inch from header top (ruffle above the rod pocket) to bottom of panel and includes 2 standard tiebacks. Regatta Tailored Panel Pair Curtains can be combined with coordinating Tailored Tier Curtains, Valances and Shower Curtain, all available on Amazon. Made in the USA, Machine Washable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cIeLEZSbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ellis Curtain","source_asin":"B008B4W3ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008B4W3ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008B4W3ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702192,"name":"Oh You're Lovely Wood Flower Rosa 2.5 inches Sold by The Dozen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ef-3TJEEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect curled rose for any arrangement! A classic tried a true rose. With this rose there is a chance when dyeing it, if watered down paint is used that the rose may potentially uncurl. Try drying the flowers upside down to help with flowers not uncurling as much Features: Available 2.5 inches (6cm) (smaller and larger sizes available see individual listings) Soft, pliable, and easy to dye. Unique designs in every bouquet. Sold by the dozen Please note these sola flowers are handmade and there can be a slight difference in size and shape from flower to flower. Sola flowers are not fresh flowers. They are handmade wood flowers. The texture is similar to a really thin version of balsa wood. Because they are handmade, and made from natural materials, no two are exactly alike. Brown veining, sometimes small holes from a \"knot\" in the wood are on some of the flowers due to being made from the bark of a tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ef-3TJEEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oh You're Lovely","source_asin":"B07WKKF8G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WKKF8G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WKKF8G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702193,"name":"Office Chair Home Ergonomic Computer Hight Back Executive Desk Chairs, Adjustable Height Flip-Up Armrest Lumbar Support and Tilt Swivel Rocking PU Lea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o+p-CnPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL-This executive office task chair is made of bonded leather, which has good toughness and prevents scratches, in addition to being stain-resistant and easy to clean. This boss chair is designed with a modern classic shape that is suitable for any office scenario and is a rare and stylish decorative piece. ✅COMFORTABLE & SOFT SEAT - This office chair is designed with high resilience sponge cushion, and the thickness of the cushion is 2-3 times the general chair, making the chair has a better comfort. In addition, the front of the chair cushion is waterfall design, which can well promote blood circulation and maintain good health. ✅SPACE SABING FLIP ARMREST - This advanced computer desk chair is designed with flip armrests, which can save you space and also give you more extra space in the seat, so that the legs can have more sitting options. And the armrests of the chair are designed with soft leather cushions, which can provide good support for your hands. ✅TILTABLE ROCKING DESIGN - The tall office chair uses pneumatic controls to freely adjust the height of the seat. Pull out the handle (right side of the chair) to tilt backward, and push in to stop tilting. The lower tilt tension knob controls the tilt tension, which you can adjust to your personal preference. This gives your back and head a better rest to stay focused on your work. ✅STURDY & DURABLE CONSTRUCTION - The chair is SGS certified with a heavy-duty nylon base construction and smooth rolling casters for great stability and mobility. In addition, the chair has a large capacity of up to 255 pounds, making it suitable for use by most people.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o+p-CnPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCQ","source_asin":"B0BC8QH8JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC8QH8JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC8QH8JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
