window.products.push({"id":702244,"name":"Tirrito Monamour 14 Inch Ceramic Sushi Platter, Porcelain Matte Sushi Serving Plates for Party and Catering, Set of 3 (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516cNx27o2L._AC_SL1180_.jpg","description":"I. About matte glaze: -The formation of matte texture is due to the micro crystal generating during the cooling phase, which required a particular (slower) cooling schedule after the firing. Numerous micro crystals generating during this process, which refract the light, makes the ceramic product matte. -The matte glaze is the trend of modern ceramic products, which is produced with advanced craftsmanship. Matte glazes can be just as “smooth” as gloss glazes, yet without fierce reflection of light, which gives it a visual effect of gentleness, coziness, which is simple, natural and yet elegant. -It is easy to clean and anti-slip due to the matte texture. II. Production Description: -Unique design, crafted with smooth glaze finish, which is sleek, elegant and yet simple. -Durable and sturdy porcelain platter, chip-resistant and high temperature resistant, safe in dishwasher, microwave, oven etc. -Stackable and save space, easy to clean by hand if needed. -Made of natural raw material, non-toxic, lead free, safe and healthy. -Rectangle tray with polished edge, and the bottom is polished to protect your table while ensure it anti-slip. -Measures 14x4.75 inch, a little longer than ordinary trays, perfect size serving tray and platter for any occasion such as family dinner and event parties. III. Tips: -If they break into pieces during delivery, take photo and contact us on your order page, we will send replacement or initiate fast refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516cNx27o2L._AC_SL1180_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monamour","source_asin":"B0831239Z1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0831239Z1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0831239Z1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
