window.products.push({"id":702255,"name":"Mezuzah Case - Mezuzah Cover, Pomegranate Tree Design Crafted in Pewter, Jerusalem Judaica, Door Mezuza Case 4\" White Wedding Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bRq5gztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔷This exquisite Mezuzah Case is set with Design of Wooden Texture Pomegranate Tree, Tree of Life 🔷 🔶 We've fashioned it from fine Pewter, then meticulously hand enameled,Truly a special piece for Judaica gift 🔶 The Jewish mitzvah to place a mezuzah on the doorpost of the home comes from Deut. 6:4-9, a well known passage commonly referred to as the Shema.  In that passage, G-d Tell us to keep His words constantly in our minds and in our hearts by writing them on the doorposts of our home. 🔷Mezuzah Case 4’- Handmade Jeweled Design 🔷 Height: 4 inches Width: 0.8 inches 🌟You Choose the Right one 🌟","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bRq5gztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Judaica","source_asin":"B078XJCBBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078XJCBBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078XJCBBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702256,"name":"Mombake Reusable Silicone Cupcake Liners/Baking Cups BPA Free, Assorted Colors 12-Count(Standard, 4 Colors)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6147sVed64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of food grade silicone, Mombake standard baking cups are BPA free, to ensure no harmful substances when baked at high temperatures, so you can use them with no worries and enjoy your tasty muffins with kids. These premium silicone muffin cups work with any standard muffin pan and free your hands from the cleaning work. Mixed 4 bright colors - black, light blue, purple, pink. Baking Cupcakes/Muffins: Oven temperature: 350℉/175℃ Baking time: regular sized 18-25 minutes; mini 9-15 minutes Mombake - Thinks like a Mom Love & Responsibility Brand Story The founder of Mombake, Mrs. Shao is a baking enthusiast, also a Mom of 3 lovely kids. She started to bake when her first boy baby was born, and showed growing interest for baking when her second girl baby was born. She practised her baking skills as often as she can while looking after her babies, in order to treat them to sweet cupcakes and yummy biscuits when they grow up. When she saw three small satisfied faces after her deliciously-baked muffins tasted, Mrs. Shao thought everything she had done was worthwhile and gained the motivation to continue to improve. She regards the children's health as her primary responsibility and puts it in the first place. While improving the baking skills, she is very picky about bakeware, and only selecting healthy, environmentally-friendly and quality cupcake liners, muffin pans and other baking tools. Those baked delicious desserts always reminded Mrs. Shao that her mother still remained at the oven in the kitchen, watching the color of the bread on a hot summer day. That's not just bread! Yes, that is the love of a mom. She always remembers her mother's love for her and her love for children; she is crazy about baking. So Mrs. Shao combined \"Mom\" with \"bake\" and created the brand of \"Mombake\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6147sVed64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mombake","source_asin":"B081GKGTZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081GKGTZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081GKGTZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
