window.products.push({"id":702335,"name":"Uxcell Cucurbit Shaped Roller Ball Shower Curtain Ring Hooks, Green, 12 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618FiC0C4NL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Metal shower curtain hooks with a few extra touches. easy-glide decorative beads complement the curtain inside and out, and the latch adjustment is simple and secure. metal- corrosion free - chrome plated - polished for a great look - easy to install - friction free, gliding action - improves lifetime of your shower curtain - dimensions 75x40mm this set of twelve metal roller hooks from splash home provides an attractive and smooth-operating system for hanging a shower curtain. fashioned from chrome-finished steel, the hooks are rust- and corrosion-resistant for lasting good looks. their simple but clever design combines smooth roller balls and a seamless pinch-clasp design, so the curtain moves easily but stays put on the hooks. attractively modern yet understated, the hooks coordinate with almost any contemporary dé cor and work equally well with liners and curtains. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618FiC0C4NL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B011R53RBU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011R53RBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011R53RBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702336,"name":"Johnson Brothers Old Britain Castles Blue Creamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZGWCFCPZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This historical and traditional pattern, Old British Castles, intricately rendered by a Miss Fennel back in 1928. She, the daughter of a Master Engraver, created these original drawings from old book photographs and steel engravings. OBC is certainly one of the best known patterns from Johnson Brothers and has been in production since 1930. Each piece of china depicting a scene of a different castle has extended to 45 castles. Some of the most famous castles included in the OBC Pattern are - Cambridge, Dunstable, Exeter, Haddon Hall, Kent, Stratford, and Warwick. The Old British Castles blue creamer featuring Goodrich and Brougham Castle -- use it everyday or for your most formal settings. Whether you prefer, milk, half and half, or cream you will prefer it served in this elegant creamer. Additional accessories available in this pattern. Amazon.com Depicting some of Britian's oldest castles with intricate detail, this 70-year-old Johnson Brothers dinnerware pattern appropriately bears the name Old British Castles. Although traditional in appearance, the high quality earthenware construction and glossy finish give the collection the strength to function comfortably in today's fast paced households. Each chip-resistant piece ably withstands the rigors associated with modern kitchen conveniences such as microwaves, freezers, and dishwashers. With a pale cream background, this 12-ounce creamer depicts its images in a beautifully contrasting navy blue. On one side, Goodrich Castle sits nestled amongst some trees while on the other Brougham Castle sits off behind a low hill. Resting evenly on four legs, the square body measures 6 by 3-1/2 by 3-1/4 inches and features sides possessing a subtly wavy texture. The opening offers a generous spout on one side and an irregularly scalloped rim. This piece fits comfortably in both casual and formal environments and can be set with matching dinnerware and additional serveware for a highly coordinated table. -- Amy Arnold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZGWCFCPZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Johnson Brothers","source_asin":"B0000B2MCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000B2MCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000B2MCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
