window.products.push({"id":702461,"name":"Pleasant Home Washcloths Set - 12 Pack (12” x 12”) – 488 GSM- 100% Ring Spun Cotton Wash Cloth - Super Soft and Highly Absorbent Face Towels (Light Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aYHa2wObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ring Spun Cotton MULTI-PURPOSE VALUE PACK: You can use these light-weight and durable washcloths in your own bathroom, as gym towels, as cleaning rags, or for your guest room. These absorbent washcloths are perfect for your daily use and are reusable promoting a healthier, cleaner environment. CARE FOR YOUR TOWELS: Wash your towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. Always wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. Machine wash cold with mild detergent and tumble dry low. We advise against the use of fabric softeners which may reduce absorbency and may cause discoloration. HIGHLY ABSORBENT AND SUPER SOFT: These washcloths have been designed for maximum water absorbency but at the same time they are light weight for easy drying and easy care. 100% ring-spun cotton makes our towels ultra-soft and hypoallergenic for everyone to use. LONG LASTING AND QUICK DRY: Our washcloths are machine washable, dryer friendly and will retain their softness and absorbency after years of wash and dry cycles. These washcloths come with a double stitched hem preventing unravelling ensuring long lasting use. COMPLEMENTS YOUR BATHROOM DÉCOR: Transform your own bathroom into a spa with these 100% ring-spun cotton highly absorbent wash cloths to match your décor. Our washcloths come in a variety of designs and striking colors to choose from.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aYHa2wObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PH Pleasant Home","source_asin":"B087TTWWL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087TTWWL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087TTWWL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
