window.products.push({"id":702464,"name":"Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set (2 Pack), Rechargeable - No Battery Needed - Automatic Salt Pepper Mill Grinder, Adjustable Coarseness, LED Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y2NKLKZ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rechargeable Pepper Grinder. Advanced Type-C fast charging technology enables the salt and pepper grinder to get a full charge in 1 hour. Only a 5-minute charge will satisfy your daily basic grinding needs. Support use it while it’s charging if you’re in a hurry. A money-saving solution wastes no more primary batteries for environmental protection. One-Hand Automatic Operation. Grind the spices automatically rather than twist repeatedly. The automatic salt and pepper grinder set is more convenient and effort-saving than traditional ones. Control the seasoning amount by the button. Separate the battery and spice container to prevent the spice powder from getting inside for a prolonged lifespan. 5-Level Adjustable Coarseness. Choose the coarseness of grains according to your preference. Rotate the knob on the bottom clockwise for a finer grind or anticlockwise for a coarse grind. Utilize the durable and safe 304 stainless steel drive shaft to bring spices into wanted granular sizes. Spread freshly ground spices for added flavor and taste. 70ml See-Through Container. Adopt food-grade ABS material to build the spice container, which is large enough to hold 70ml of spices and requires less refilling. A transparent lid increases visibility to distinguish the spices or check how much remains. A cover for the pepper grinder prevents dust and stops the spice powder from making a mess. 2-Pack Pepper Grinder Set. The salt and pepper grinder set comes in two colors(white/black) for holding different spices to avoid mixing up. Suitable for pepper, salt, rosemary, cumin seeds, red pepper, etc. A LED light keeps on while grinding to control the seasoning and avoid over-seasoning. We offer a one-year warranty; contact us if necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y2NKLKZ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRTONYI","source_asin":"B0C7KCVD2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7KCVD2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7KCVD2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702465,"name":"Window Toppers Stephanie Country Style Ruffle 3 Piece Swag Curtains Set 132 Inch W by 63 Inch L - 3 Inch Rod Pocket, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lzCld1NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Stephanie Country Ruffle 3 Piece Swags & Filler Valance Curtain Sets can be ordered in a choice of 2 color fabrics and 45, 54 & 63 inch lengths. Each 3 piece set includes one pair of ruffled swags + one matching filler valance (as pictured). These charming country ruffled swag curtain sets are adorned with 5 1/2 inch wide country ruffles and can be ordered with a choice of 1 1/2 inch or 3 inch rod pocket (Product is pictured with a 3 inch rod pocket). One 132 inch wide swag curtains set will accommodate approximately 30 - 45 inches of window width, and can easily be adapted to accommodate wider window widths by adding/purchasing additional filler valances (add/purchase one additional filler valance for every 15-20 inches of added window width as needed) to place between the swags. Length measurement is measured from the top stitch line of the rod pocket to the bottom edge/longest point of the curtain. Width is measured Overall, 132 inches wide per 3 piece set including ruffle for all 3 pieces together. Fabric is 70% polyester/30% cotton for easy care, machine washable. Sold as a set, 3 pieces. Picture shows one 3 piece set. *Coordinating Ruffled Privacy Tiers are available and sold separately in our Amazon storefront. We also offer coordinating Ruffled Priscillas with Bow Tie Backs and choice of 3 Valances, which are all sold separately. Made in the USA !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lzCld1NXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Window Toppers","source_asin":"B005H0DLP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005H0DLP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005H0DLP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702466,"name":"Owlgift Vintage Gourd Style Dome Shaped Metal Hat Rack/Cap/Wig Holder Free Standing Display Rack, Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810flCvn7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vintage Gourd Style Dome Shaped Metal Hat Rack / Cap / Wig Holder Free Standing Display Rack, Bronze -Elegantly designed, Victorian style hat/wig holder display stand. -Dome shaped top for hanging caps, fedoras, beanies, and any hats you can imagine. -Also perfect for displaying wigs. -Made of bronze metal. -Approximate Dimensions: 6\" W x 6\" D x 13\" H. Hat dome: 5.5\" Diameter. For the person who wears many hats, this vintage style hat & wig display stand is the perfect accessory for your home or store. Smooth, circular features come together to form a dome ideal for hanging caps, fedoras, beanies, and any hats you can possibly imagine. The dome shaped design on this hat rack also works perfectly for wigs of all types. Keep this hat rack on your dresser to show off your head accessories while keeping them organized and pristine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810flCvn7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Owlgift","source_asin":"B07PWGWL16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWGWL16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWGWL16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
