window.products.push({"id":702531,"name":"Concentrated Fragrance Oil - Scent - Rain Water: A Very Fresh Clean Scent. Begins w/ Lily & Crisp White Grapefruit w/ Vanilla, Sandalwood Infused w/Es","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gcEEODFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use 4-6 Drops of Concentrated fragrance oil in a fragrance oil warmer. Tip: a few drops will revitalize your wax melts Many Fragrances and Sizes Available. ----------- About Us: We have been selling candles and wax tarts in North Carolina for several years. We have done shows and local selling and have decided it is time to branch out. Handcrafting was once a proud standard in America that is now diminishing. We take great pride in our candle creations and hope they will provide you with much enjoyment. ----- Shipping: Items will be sent via USPS. Orders are filled Monday-Friday. Our offices are closed Saturday, Sunday and Holidays. Please allow 1 business day processing time. During warmer weather candles and tarts may soften. This is normal. Simply allow your item to cool before use. No international shipping at this time. We do ship to Alaska, Puerto Rico, and Hawaii. ----- Cautions: Keep out of reach of children and pets. Melted wax gets very hot and can cause burns, please use caution when handling hot wax. Allow candles, wax and wax warmer to cool before moving, covering or removing wax. This product contains oils that may cause damage to fabrics and other surfaces. Store in a cool dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gcEEODFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stand Around Creations","source_asin":"B018HRR1AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018HRR1AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018HRR1AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702532,"name":"Wicked-Cool! Insulated Beer Bottle Cooler Cover 12-oz Capacity 3-Piece Stainless-Steel Cover with Bonus Playing Card Opener and Craft Beer Ebook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jK5MfsLRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cool and cover your favorite bottled drinks with this portable bottle cooler value set. Stainless-steel body unscrews for easy loading while double-wall insulation keeps your drinks cold anywhere you go. Preserve Your Beverages in Any Weather There's nothing more frustrating than feeling your ice-cold beer quickly turn warm in the summer heat. Even worse, that slippery, sweaty beer bottle makes shaking hands and hitting the snack table a problem. The durable stainless steel cooler cover slips over your 12-ounce bottles to keep drinks cool and hands dry. This simple design offers practical solutions to your on-the-go sipping and backyard brews: *Looped lid allows easy carrying with keychain attachment. *Threaded closure provides airtight seal to keep your drink fresh. *Beer bottle rim sits above the steel lip for easy sipping. *Neoprene insulation preserves chill. *Attached bottle opener cracks beer bottles in a pinch. *Tarnish-resistant stainless-steel body also prevents shatters and spills. To clean your cooler, simply disassemble and hand wash. Allow all pieces to dry completely before use. Travel-Ready Bottle Carrying Bring your insulated cover on your next boat trip, camping adventure, tailgate party, or beach day to sip safely with friends and family. Its metal exterior will prevent broken bottles and problematic spills while also concealing your bottle for complete \"beverage anonymity\" in public spaces. Wherever the weekend takes you, this concealed bottle cover keeps your drink of choice at its best. Pick up your own beer bottle insulated cooler cover bundle today or grab a few extras as gifts!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jK5MfsLRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wicked-Cool!","source_asin":"B01INSMXIC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01INSMXIC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01INSMXIC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
