window.products.push({"id":702628,"name":"Pendezo 6 Shot Glass Dispenser, glass shot, shot dispenser, Multi shot dispenser,Comes with Cleaning Brush, Game Dice, Silicon Plugs,6 Plastic glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bkqwbB6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pendezo Dispenser and Holders * 🥃 Fill Cups in Seconds .Pendezo dispenser is equipped with 6 cups. You can easily but accurately fill multiple small cups evenly within a few seconds, really a neat and elegant way of dispensing. Enjoy a good wine time when you are at home, very suitable for vacations, party bars and family bars. Get the Party Started Faster! * 🥃 Upgrade Accessories. To meet each of your needs, we prepare extra accessories for you. The silicone plugs allow you to fill any number of small cups as you need, the cleaning brush makes your cleaning work simple and convenient, the game dice allows you to add more fun as you entertain yourself and your friends. * 🥃 Perfect Design & Material.All of our shot glasses dispenser and holder stand are 3D Printed, beautiful appearance; Selected high quality Food Grade PLA materials, absolutely safe and harmless. Note: The liquid must be poured directly into the center to ensure even distribution into each small glass! * 🥃 Easy to Use and Portable. Pour the liquid slowly toward the center of the wine dispenser. * 🥃 Packgage List & Our Guarantee. Comes with 1X Shot glass dispenser, 6 X Acrylic Glass Cups, , 1 X Cleaning brush, 6 X Silicone plug, and 1* Game Dice .We do our best to source the most unique and innovative products to make sure each of our customer has the best shopping experience from us. 🥃👩‍🍳 How it works * 1. You simply place one shot glass under each spout. * 2. There are six spouts and you pour your drink of choice directly into the top of Dispenser. * 3. Then it dispenses that liquid to all the shot glasses below and boom, you have shots in 6 small glasses instantly. * 4. It even includes a carrier, so you can simply lift it up and bring them over to your friends. * 5. You can use the silicone plugs to plug into the spouts to change the numbers of the cups as you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bkqwbB6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pendezo","source_asin":"B08RMSDC3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RMSDC3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RMSDC3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
