window.products.push({"id":702722,"name":"AGILLY 3-in-1 Evaporative Air Cooler, 3 Wind Speeds, 60°Oscillation Swamp Cooler, 12H Timer, Remote Control & LED Screen, Portable Air Conditioner Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zwSG0RLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❅[DO SOMETHING COOL WITH YOUR SUMMER] If you are still looking for a fashionable way to get cool in the summer, Agilly 3 in 1 evaporative air cooler will be your ideal choice!This evaporative cooler comes with 3-layer evaporative cooloing pad and Extra Cooling System that absorb the hot and dry air and keeps it cool while operating, can be used as a fan, humidifier, or air cooler.The upper and bottom water tanks are designed to accommodate more ice packs to achieve longer-term cooling. ❅[Smart & Safety Design] Built-in LED Display panel is visiable to allow you to customize personal mode at a glance. Conjunction with the 20ft remote control, you don't have to get up from sofa or bed. Thanks to the tip-over protection and closable blade designs on this evaporative air conditioner, it is much safer to use in the household that have children or pets.The horizontal blades can manually close and is safer for little fingers that like to touch. ❅[4 Pre-programmed Modes,3 Wind Speeds&12 HRS Timing] Easy to control with 3-speed settings plus 4 Pre-programmed Modes meet all the needs for coolness–normal, sleep, natural, or cooling.Whether it is immersing in your own activities or gathering with friends, it will always be with you.Meanwhile, it has an extended timer up to 12 hrs and would do a better job of ambient temp reduction if you left it running for that long and will automatically turn off if oversleep or leaving. ❅[60° Oscillation & 360° Swivel Wheels] Agilly compact and portable air cooler is easy to carry and storage which fits in most spaces.60° oscillating angel distributes coolness effectively around area such as bedroom,kitchen,nursery and office.With 360° Swivel Wheels,it can follow you anywhere.It's lightweight and has multiple handling areas for ease of comfort.The compact body is so easy to tuck in a corner without taking up too much space. ❅[Agilly,a Green and Environmental- friendly New Fashion.] Agilly adopts evaporative air refrigeration technology and will not produce exhaust gas and harmful substances like ac.By adding ice packs or cold water, you can easily enjoy extra coolness in seconds with a low cost.With ECO mode design,just one click to turn off the panel lights, and no worry about being disturbed at night by the lights.The lights are on top and near the back so you don't see them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zwSG0RLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGILLY","source_asin":"B09NBGD4R5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBGD4R5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBGD4R5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702723,"name":"Burnt Burgundy 6\" Taper Candle with Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EkKMQHy5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Battery candle taper candle in burnt burgundy. The dipped wax finish has a cinnamon grungy coating for a bumpy finish. 6\" taper is powered by 2 AA batteries (batteries not included). These primitive decor taper candles offer a warm glow without cords, fire danger or hassle. Burgundy candle with cinnamon grungy coating gives these tapers a true primitive look. No cords, no turning the candle on and off, it's all automatic and offers a warm flickering glow from dusk to bedtime or ideal on a mantle during the day when you want a flickering accent to warm your room. Our timer candles stay on for 6 hours and go off for 18 hours. The 6 hours begins when batteries are activated. To reset on/off time, simply remove batteries and put back in at the time you want the candle to burn. Safe for tables and little ones with no danger of fire! You provide the candle holder and batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21EkKMQHy5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Battery Operated Taper Candle","source_asin":"B00EW43BXI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EW43BXI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EW43BXI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
