window.products.push({"id":702777,"name":"abteata Decorative Pillow Covers, 100% Cotton Throw Pillow Covers, Cushion Pillow Case 18x18 inch, Animal Printed Toile Pillow Covers for Couch Sofa I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719kXy4iXyS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Material: 100% Cotton Fabric, 265gsm Thick, Super Durable Soft and Comfortable. Size:18 x 18 inches/ 45 x 45 cm. Suitable for Cushion Size 20x20 inches, 50x50cm. Edge:Unique Edge Design, Hidden Zipper Sewed with Neat Stitches Works Smoothly. Package: 1piece Pillow Cover Only With No Cushion Insert. Machine Washable: Wash with cold water, Gentle Cycle, & Tumble Dry Low, Use Low Iron If Needed. Do Not Bleach Them Or Run Them Through a Hot Dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719kXy4iXyS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"abteata","source_asin":"B096S538ZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096S538ZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096S538ZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702778,"name":"Thomas Kinkade London 20\"x20\" Special Edition Canvas Wrap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310Mis80eKL._AC_.jpg","description":"The thatch-roofed cottages of rural England have charmed and intrigued me; the splendid manor houses scattered throughout the countryside have tantalized me with their taste of noble living. But I have never before painted the great English metropolis, the bustling, light filled jewel of nostalgia and history that is London. London is the rarest of contemporary cities - at once rich with picturesque landmarks and invigorated by modern energies. I set up my easel at just this spot to capture its two faces. I painted within the shadows of Westminster Bridge, ancient and massive, while a regal sunset illuminated the reflections of the House of Parliament and the Tower of Big Ben in the silvery water of the Thames. A stately old tug boat passed by as I painted and I decided to include it in my London. I had some fun with the river, hiding the periscope of a vintage submarine in its depths - perhaps an outgrowth of my recent readings regarding London's participation as our ally during the war my father fought in - World War II. And does that bottle bobbing under the bridge hold a love letter to my wife Nanette, or is it instead a love letter to this glorious city? -Thomas Kinkade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310Mis80eKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thomas Kinkade","source_asin":"B00B90HRIS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B90HRIS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B90HRIS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
