window.products.push({"id":702965,"name":"Mini Silicone Serving Tongs Set of 3 - Non-stick Small Kitchen Tongs (7 inch) with Silicone Tips and Stainless Steel Handle, Cooking Tongs for Salads,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WcRV4KI9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ 【Set Includes】You will get three 7inch silicone serving tongs, two basic food tongs, and one spatula tong. Tongs are suitable for serving food. These are enough for personal service at the buffet or table. ✔ 【Premium Material】The tips of mini kitchen tongs are made of food grade silicone, the handles are made of premium stainless steel which is durable. The silicone tips of the small tongs can withstand temperatures from -104°F to 446°F. ✔ 【Practical Design】The pull ring design can be used to open and close your cooking tongs. Cooking tongs can be hung on the wall, saving your storage space and easy to store. ✔ 【Multiple Uses】Small tongs can be used for buffet, homemade salad, fried foods, Ice. Tongs set meets most of our needs in our daily life. It is perfect as a gift for family and friends. ✔ 【Easy To Clean】Kitchen tongs are suitable for cooking, serving. Food won't stick to them, so to clean them only takes rinse with hot soapy water or just take them in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WcRV4KI9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pharamat","source_asin":"B0C1BS52TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1BS52TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1BS52TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":702966,"name":"Bedshelfie Bedside Shelf for Bunk Bed & Top Bunk, College Dorm Room Essentials, Loft Bed Accessories, Clip On Nightstand Snack Organizer, Floating Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dICHIjTnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE DESIGN OPTIONS: The Plus size (19.25 x 11.5'') of the Bedshelfie bedside shelf was designed specifically to hold a 16-inch MacBook Pro laptop. With 7 styles to choose from, including the Minimalist (13.75 x 9.5''), Original (13.75 x 9.5'') , Essential bed caddy with cup holder (17 x 11.6''), and Plus (19.25 x 11.5''), there's a Bedshelfie to fit every bed frame with a rail. ORIGINAL, TRIED & TRUE DESIGN: Launched from Kickstarter and designed in Los Angeles, the Bedshelfie bedside shelf has been featured on top publications such as Apartment Therapy, BuzzFeed, and Real Simple. Our original bed shelfie bed shelf organizer table helps small space dwellers make the most out of their space, from those in tiny bedrooms to college students in need of a top bunk bedside table. It is the preferred choice for bed side organization and storage. SUPERIOR QUALITY & CRAFTMANSHIP: From day one, we have been committed to creating the very best bedside shelf solutions, with furniture-grade finishes and scratch and fade-resistant coatings. Our custom-molded metal hardware is designed to last, making the BedShelfie a modern nightstand alternative or an ideal tall nightstand addition that elevates your home. EFFORTLESS NO-TOOL INSTALLATION: Our intuitive design eliminates the need for complex instruction manuals. The BedShelfie caddy tray is incredibly versatile, serving as a headboard shelf, sofa tray, changing table, or cord organizer. It is particularly popular with city dwellers, as one of dorm room essentials for college students, a room decor, a teen room nightstand or a kids side table. Safely holding up to 35lbs, this floating nightstand can hold a 13-inch MacBook, phone, water, and more! BUILT TO LAST FOR A LIFETIME: We stand behind every Bedshelfie bedside shelf we make, and our exceptional customer service is available for the life of your Bedshelfie. The Bedshelfie bed side table / night stand comes in Bamboo (Natural, Black, White, and Gray) and Eco-Hard Recyclable Plastic (Black and White) and is designed to last for years to come. Make the Bedshelfie bedside table a staple in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dICHIjTnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BedShelfie","source_asin":"B09XL9RR3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XL9RR3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XL9RR3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
