window.products.push({"id":702992,"name":"32 Oz Glass Water Bottle 1L Quart Insulated Sleeve Stainless Steel Lid Time Marked Standard Mouth Liter Container For Drinking Travel To-Go Reusable S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j7OiKp9mL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Start your journey to healthier living with this all new Hydrate Maxx 32 ounce glass water bottle by Xtremeglas! This leak proof bottle is made with durable soda lime glass, same as what canning jars and Coke bottles are made with. The bottle features ounce and milliliter markings on one side and time markings on the other side to help keep your hydration on track. Simply fill up the bottle, and drink it down by noon. Then fill it again, and drink down by 6 pm and you have drank your recommended 64 oz of daily water intake. The TOP CARRY bottle comes with one (1) 18-8 stainless steel screw on lid (no carry strap) with removable silicone o-ring washer inside and Xtremeglas logo printed on it. The SIDE CARRY bottle comes with (2) 18-8 stainless steel screw on lids with removable silicone o-ring washers inside. One lid features a new wider black carry strap that is more comfortable to carry and leaves you confident your bottle will not drop. The other lid has no strap with our Xtremeglas logo. It's your choice which lid you prefer to use!  Our customers have grown to love the Xtremeglas line of glass water bottles. They simply love the craftsmanship of the glass and the attractive design. These are great for any occasion and they make great gifts too! Pick yours up today and get on the road to a healthier lifestyle by drinking more water with Xtremeglas! While this bottle is very durable, it is made from glass, and can still be broken. Please handle with care! Click the ADD TO CART button to get your bottle now! **Product ships in genuine Xtremeglas packaging**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j7OiKp9mL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xtremeglas","source_asin":"B06XWCYND5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-702992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XWCYND5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XWCYND5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
